      "height": 87.5,
      "text": "draft      hidden in production, visible while developing\naiWritten  never rendered, in any environment, ever — the site publishes\n           only Samuel’s own words, and the build enforces it rather than\n           trusting anyone to remember\nhidden     a project kept out of the showcase; still listed under “Also public”",
      "originalText": "draft      hidden in production, visible while developing\naiWritten  never rendered, in any environment, ever — the site publishes\n           only Samuel’s own words, and the build enforces it rather than\n           trusting anyone to remember\nhidden     a project kept out of the showcase; still listed under “Also public”",
      "fontSize": 14,
